<BaseLayout title="Single Sessions">
  <h1>Single Sessions</h1>

  <p>
    Single sessions are flexible, focused, and designed for immediate clarity.
    They are relational, reflective, and grounded in the realities people face.
  </p>

  <h2>Empathetic Listening</h2>
  <p>Non-directive, relational, spacious. A place to speak and be heard.</p>

  <h2>Solution-Focused Socratic Questioning</h2>
  <p>Structured, incisive, and oriented toward practical next steps.</p>

  <h2>AIBU / AAITA / AITOO / AIGC Vent Session</h2>
  <p>A grounded space to explore “Am I being unreasonable?”, “Am I the *******?”, “Am I the only one?”, or “Am I going crazy?”</p>

  <h2>Cheerleading & Validation</h2>
  <p>Warm, human encouragement when you need someone in your corner.</p>

  <h2>Motivation & Reorientation</h2>
  <p>Reconnecting with direction, momentum, and what matters.</p>
</BaseLayout>
